OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer Karl Bushby's
OL,4,Ahomecoming plans revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlobal adventurer Karl Bushby will be
OL,7,Fwelcomed home in Hull next week when he
OL,8,Fcompletes his 36,000-mile (58,000km)
OL,9,Fwalk.
OL,11,FThe 57-year-old set off from Chile in
OL,12,F1998, with the aim of walking home
OL,13,Fwithout using transport to advance.
OL,15,FBushby's standout moments include
OL,16,Fcrossing the Bering Strait, which
OL,17,Fstretches between the US and Russia,
OL,18,Fand hacking his way through jungle in
OL,19,Fthe Darien Gap, from Panama to
OL,20,FColombia.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
