OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer Karl Bushby's
OL,4,Ahomecoming plans revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, people are being invited to
OL,7,Fgather in Queen Victoria Square, where
OL,8,Fhe will be welcomed by Lord Mayor Maria
OL,9,FCoward, who said: "We have all felt
OL,10,Finspired by his spirit, tenacity and
OL,11,Fdogged determination to carry on in
OL,12,Fchallenges faced by the most fearless
OL,13,Fof explorers."
